{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "12ada2d1794fa869b1f77c7130c3b15b29730b42bf59779a2ff2a4c6c0001693", "ja": "クリスマス公演を控えて、\n自分たちもクリスマス気分を楽しんでいる\nアイドルたちの一幕です。", "zh": "那是圣诞公演即将来临，\n而偶像们自身也沉浸在\n圣诞节气氛中的一幕场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "150459018aba6a4bf9ff0bcebe7a5a0f0456cf740864e384633cfa6b1fcbc7db", "ja": "（もうすぐ劇場のクリスマス公演が始まる。初日は\n春香たち5人の予定だが、まだ仕事先にいるようだ）", "zh": "（再过不久，剧场的圣诞公演就要开始了。首日预计由\n春香她们5人出场，不过她们好像还在工作的地方。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3c74fc0229c8dbdc09a6dd23f697dcf8c47ce15304404e6fe6e3098adbabf8c6", "ja": "（その春香から「トナカイをお願いできませんか」\nというメッセージが届いた。これは一体……？）", "zh": "（然后春香还传了「可以拜托驯鹿吗？」\n的讯息给我。这究竟是什么意思……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "d31b5b8951ff05ae133c6722d4dace457c1719bbb77f537b2090ae3afc8b033c", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
