{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "5301e3034c9ce01a4103bfdb8e5cb2a6afd332b54d46f8d517c35b02bd51974f", "ja": "メリークリスマス♪", "zh": "圣诞快乐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6df674db38bf014036bc5670b8f913f5b25965fb2cc088ce46a90c801ef35d0d", "ja": "め、メリークリスマス……というか、\nみんな、どうしてクリスマス公演の衣装を着てるんだ？", "zh": "圣、圣诞快乐……是说，\n大家为什么穿着圣诞节公演的服装？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "3e882608ccaa9fb1d155044113ad704ace9d0484999df5a8133e2e867a3a492b", "ja": "へへっ、それはもちろん、\nクリスマス気分だからです！", "zh": "嘿嘿，那当然是因为\n我们已经沉浸在圣诞节的气氛里啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a1d0ba058a3de75447d59f3f03976f79409eacd4d67c0bf21780dd67071bef56", "ja": "（そんな理由で！？）", "zh": "（就因为这种理由！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "e74162a8f7c637de0211377a4e625458010e68c97e7160c0a4d61905c84ccb65", "ja": "ねえねえ{$P$}、見て見て？\nクリスマスっぽいミキ、かわいい？", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}你看你看，\n圣诞风的美希，可爱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "939857bf8797c658b1f4f659ea5fe081cec26ebfd3814f768844cd828dc8a15e", "ja": "あっ、ボクはどうですか？\nクリスマスなボク、キュンキュンしますか？", "zh": "啊，在下的模样如何？\n看到圣诞风的在下有没有让你心动？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_1014", "source_sha256": "3934ee2bdc90b403bb76130bc41cc4349f3300fe1b2f8a52f9680e64b8ef4b4f", "ja": "（キュン）", "zh": "（心动）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2000_p", "source_sha256": "37344c68b6b5547ecab352d9022d0018d043e33b1aae93dca630d93e39677655", "ja": "そりゃまあ、みんなかわいいし、\n似合ってるからキュンとはするけど……。", "zh": "那是当然了。\n毕竟大家都这么可爱，装扮又很合适，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2001_006mak", "source_sha256": "d7ec5b32e57c66db67093e5eacb2cdbfbd7177bc2712ce53504b84ad00f10792", "ja": "やーりぃ！　へへっ、{$P$}が\nいいなら、きっとみんなも喜んでくれるよね！", "zh": "太棒啦！嘿嘿，{$P$}觉得\n合适的话，大家一定也会很高兴的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2002_001har", "source_sha256": "d8a9e4b3a61f3ca5716b884101f4e1457b4dc99a0fcac40e402dfe190d2861ca", "ja": "実は、これからみんなで劇場に行って\nサプライズパーティーをしようって思ってるんです♪", "zh": "其实我们待会打算去剧场\n开一场惊喜派对♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2003_005yay", "source_sha256": "9c8d74a0a581305d6cd2f498a79080d9b799f8bd8900550a3633551b32e669cd", "ja": "それで、ちょっと早いですけど音無さんにお願いして、\n公演の衣装を借りてきちゃいましたっ！", "zh": "所以虽然有点早，\n我们还是拜托音无姊姊先把公演的服装借给我们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2004_002chi", "source_sha256": "3a2d5c2f8b15e54377520e8ff8b144f60ad5e0914d29a707899eefe81a7a5a9a", "ja": "高槻さん、とってもよく似合っているわ。", "zh": "高槻，你穿起来很适合喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2005_005yay", "source_sha256": "d0b1915500178638686f98c44b0b8d82bfd43899095e6e32cc02e91517464fb1", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございますー！\n千早さんも、すっごくキレイですっ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你！\n千早姊姊也非常漂亮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2006_p", "source_sha256": "2f64fa34adb8a89172fcd2f2921cd33342c01ca80b079b7b2b3709f579a10b1b", "ja": "なるほど、劇場のみんなへのサプライズってことか。\nでもパーティーって、他にも何かするのか？", "zh": "原来如此，是要给在剧场的大家一个惊喜啊。\n不过既然要开派对，也就是说还有其他的节目？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2007_005yay", "source_sha256": "bc571420ca2e3038e8cd967d94fc1801b1065d0dfe54d7d32eccf1922e276de0", "ja": "やりますよっ！\n千早さんが、私たちの歌をプレゼントしようって！", "zh": "当然有！\n千早姊姊说，要把我们的歌送给大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2008_p", "source_sha256": "e701a4ecf1085c4ef3aba2358c5b3ef64a1b22c83a97596180e0006e7f872336", "ja": "えっ。千早が、このパーティーの企画を……？", "zh": "咦？这场派对是千早策划的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2009_002chi", "source_sha256": "6a5cf2dcb477fc28a4e7355b01de968e45bac9fa770119f1411bc614f7dc0963", "ja": "ち、違います！\nパーティーの企画は、春香と真です。", "zh": "不、不是啦！\n派对是春香跟真策划的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2010_001har", "source_sha256": "29f0cb8a2de710834eda90c5859ed3fd296c64d9f24bbd6e939ee5fd65823b43", "ja": "この時期って、もうすぐクリスマスーって感じで、\nなんとなくウキウキするじゃないですか？", "zh": "现在这个时期，四处都在准备迎接圣诞节，\n不觉得有点让人期待吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2011_001har", "source_sha256": "50c0ae1807a8b1bbf34bdcb47ad113e80f399a30403d7d7f273f483697c0eec9", "ja": "劇場のみんなはどうしてるかなー、なんて思ってたら、\n何だか……一緒にお祝いしたくなっちゃって♪", "zh": "所以我心里就浮现「不知道剧场的大家都在做什么？」\n的想法，然后突然觉得……好想跟大家一起庆祝♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2012_006mak", "source_sha256": "08f0fae6320f7fcab46d74273c2242149c76221227d643e8274e95f47821c033", "ja": "それで出し物とかを考えてたら、歌がいいんじゃ\nないかって、千早が言ってくれたんだよね。", "zh": "接着我们开始构想节目，\n那时千早就提议大家一起唱歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2013_002chi", "source_sha256": "8c6b57f48e840e0ca20d7fd56f60e75920584d8c93ed5a1627700a49bf2c23fb", "ja": "……私たちのステージが参考になると、\nよく言ってもらえるから。", "zh": "……因为大家常说，\n我们的表演很值得作为参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2014_002chi", "source_sha256": "ef8fa257198b7d520ada6453d3c8e7495cba77af8ebc4873c25d503aba71d241", "ja": "それに、親しい誰かのために、クリスマスソングを\n歌うことは……その、いい経験になると思って。", "zh": "再说，为亲近的人演唱圣诞歌曲……\n那个，感觉会是场不错的经验。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2015_p", "source_sha256": "41dab24017acd250b6b1bff09027d030d8b0d0e0907338b986f6e1d41bbc88b1", "ja": "……そうだな。それはすごく、\n意味のあることだと思うよ。", "zh": "……说得也是。\n我觉得，这是相当有意义的事喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2016_005yay", "source_sha256": "6ba8f2c9ea925b91118421c65b7665ec81830446f9e3a32007b00ab14b3d2951", "ja": "えへへっ、みんな、喜んでくれますよね？", "zh": "嘿嘿，大家会不会觉得开心呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2017_p", "source_sha256": "191f341ed6baf8f65fc629dbcf3dc3051c9205607cf8a7e91ccc119ced8ffb8b", "ja": "もちろん！　劇場のみんなにとっても、\n最高のクリスマスプレゼントになるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "当然会！对剧场的大家来说，\n这应该是一份最棒的圣诞礼物吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2018_001har", "source_sha256": "2f11d0c2674456e02df0cff04b5804a226445a682bba538324939e119de4961b", "ja": "そうなるといいなって思ってます♪\nあ、それで、お願いのことなんですけど……。", "zh": "如果是这样就好了♪\n啊，说到这个，我刚才拜托你的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2019_p", "source_sha256": "81ffe5c2c0001a05faf68364f96d5f9c1adb660914b4755ed299214eadc92dd7", "ja": "そうだ、トナカイを頼むって、一体どういう……", "zh": "对了，拜托驯鹿到底是指什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2020_p", "source_sha256": "5b402b71ffa8e3c6b8507de3729e22603a0da555c872ac37128e62b1d4f5cd4a", "ja": "ん？　もしかして、俺にもトナカイのコスプレを？", "zh": "嗯？难不成是要我扮成驯鹿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2021_006mak", "source_sha256": "53a10807a3b543421231078e6b06525e518743a3e4eaf058bf40d7707dae4535", "ja": "あっ、いいですねソレ！\nいただきました！", "zh": "啊，这个点子不错耶！\n采用！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2022_003mik", "source_sha256": "43f9cc984d04953dec03cbe93b8b0fb647f040132dbee052ac63e5c5f50183de", "ja": "ミキ的にも、すっごく見てみたいってカンジ☆\nトナカイプロデューサー、ステージデビューなの♪", "zh": "美希也想看看耶☆\n驯鹿制作人首度登台唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2023_p", "source_sha256": "2fdf680e78ea55da345b0efddd9967b50cc0158505a642d5b6d42dc53289379a", "ja": "いや、違うならデビューしないぞ？\n春香、どういう意味だったんだ？", "zh": "不不，如果春香没有那个打算，我是不会登台的喔。\n春香，那句话是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2024_001har", "source_sha256": "923c624ea43489521c5c141b83191c15ac1e004bbbc4762b808a219d379bf652", "ja": "すみません！　実は、劇場のみんなにナイショに\nできるように、ここで着替えちゃったんですけど……。", "zh": "对不起！其实为了不让剧场的大家发现，\n我们先在这里换装了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2025_001har", "source_sha256": "de8153fd2840430f22f243759dd569f1872a786e1ad56ee42ead5def706745e0", "ja": "その……このまま外に出るわけにいかないので、\nできたら、車を出してもらえないかな～って……。", "zh": "然后……因为穿成这样不好在外面走动，\n所以想问你，方便的话能不能载我们一程这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2026_p", "source_sha256": "9bdece7985ac32eae2c760e0adf63fc6495d4e1f1d7e4b93c8e4a2f752dfc509", "ja": "つまり、サンタのみんなを運ぶトナカイ役って事か。\nそれならお安い御用だ。任せてくれ！", "zh": "这么说，驯鹿是指载各位圣诞老人到会场去的角色啊。\n小事一桩，交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2027_003mik", "source_sha256": "0bf097f42aec7d6fe10b77a3f0380871a3121277949126f1087dcd6c3d3822ab", "ja": "わーい♪　クリスマスのドライブデート、\nいっぱい楽しもうね☆", "zh": "耶～♪那我们要尽情享受\n圣诞节的兜风约会唷☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2028_006mak", "source_sha256": "0c191d263e9425d5276be91e76c9ab1c48ab7aab82d27094246fec55a27ee538", "ja": "助かります！　向こうについたら、パーティーの準備\nとかはボク達でしますから、安心してくださいね！", "zh": "谢谢啰！到了剧场之后，\n我们会负责准备派对的，请你放心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2029_005yay", "source_sha256": "41c3ce43a6bf3f83b36487c1c5cc293989b01c6e31c49a4ebc23a91b20f49038", "ja": "パーティーでは私たちがサンタさんですから、\n{$P$}も楽しんでくださいねっ！", "zh": "在派对中我们是圣诞老人，\n所以{$P$}也跟大家一起享受派对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2030_002chi", "source_sha256": "17a5360640ab6c55faa4918cf22b52b3368349bf790262aec31f13497953b6a1", "ja": "今日の私たちが歌を届けたいのは……\n{$P$}も、ですから。", "zh": "因为我们今天唱的歌……\n也是要送给{$P$}的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2031_p", "source_sha256": "1bd9f45d5040bfa3541ab3936ff35983dc5f9a9dd95f82916e94aa66ef843b7b", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。それじゃお言葉に甘えて、\n俺はのんびりさせてもらうよ。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢你们。\n那我就恭敬不如从命，悠闲享受派对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2032_p", "source_sha256": "0bdebd63e25091f6ca20b9f8dfbf98abd99d3f758b41007abfba462f24cffe72", "ja": "そういえば……\nクリスマスソングは、何を歌うんだ？", "zh": "话说回来……\n你们准备唱哪一首圣诞歌曲？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2033_001har", "source_sha256": "1c29d35b780e14ddc5626ad659bbc5e47fec23817d4162e29f6210489af146e0", "ja": "迷ったんですけど、楽しいのがいいかな～って思って…\n選んだのは、この曲です♪", "zh": "我们也犹豫了很久，后来觉得开朗一点的歌比较好……\n所以选了这首歌♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_009_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_009_gc_01_2034_001har", "source_sha256": "1169fcd5f1474d8d437df64a3aa0af28956981a5d43dc03cb1ddd6cafb79f550", "ja": "『メリー』！", "zh": "『Merry』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
